tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/514830/extras/972fad9ca3fdf5d74a22a23f1452262d.webp?t=1548759874\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/514830/extras/c2166aeca470bcaa078195c396dd0324.poster.avif?t=1548759874\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/514830/extras/c2166aeca470bcaa078195c396dd0324.webm?t=1548759874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/514830/extras/c2166aeca470bcaa078195c396dd0324.mp4?t=1548759874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>If Stifled seemed familiar, well it is because its Spiritual Predecessor, Lurking has been played by some of your favorite let\u2019s players!",
